        ":question/id": "4dc3eacb-46c7-508e-b6f6-45a1b923dac8",
        ":question/problem": "Find the particular solution to the differential equation below that satisfies the condition $f(0)=-2.$\n\n$$\n(1+2x){f}^{\u2032}(x)-2=0.\n$$",
        ":question/answer-fields": [
          {
            ":answer-field/id": "71b1dffd-875e-5707-8866-e66dab3cc185",
